{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-05-10 11:05:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK RECOGNIZED AS BEST U.S. COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY BY NATIONAL DIVERSITY COUNCIL', 'text': "DALLAS , MAY 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE NATIONAL DIVERSITY COUNCIL (NDC) RECOGNIZED COMERICA BANK'S ONGOING COMMITMENT TO DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION, NAMING THE BANK TO ITS BEST U.S. COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LISTING. COMERICA IS ONE OF FOUR COMPANIES RECEIVING THE HONOR THIS YEAR, WHICH WAS ANNOUNCED IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE RELEASE OF THE 2022 NDC INDEX."}